  "abstract": null,
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><h2 id=\"h490b8bf-fZ1i9PFT\" data-id=\"h490b8bf-fZ1i9PFT\">报表数据</h2><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-Ah4C7R0Q\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-C5vxVhJN\">数据报表是对账户内所有投放后的数据进行全方位，客观严谨的分析，通过比如<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">消耗</span></code>&nbsp;、<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">展示数</span></code>&nbsp;、<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">点击数</span></code>、<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">转化数</span></code>&nbsp;、<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">深度转化数</span></code>等指标，方便客户进行数据分析，精准作出投放策略，以提高投放效果；<br>数据报表：客户数据、项目数据、营销计划数据、营销创意数据、视频素材数据（消耗数据，互动流失数据）、图片素材数据、关键词数据、搜索词数据、试玩素材数据；</p></blockquote><p data-id=\"p838747a-Rd4UNFaH\"><img src=\"https://p6-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/73eed425bca14898987cae116dbe986a~noop.image?x-expires=1988708262&amp;x-signature=q1wtj0JojlKh3YPNz%2FiCdr6fE7c%3D\" alt=\"image.png\" title=\"image.png\" data-auto=\"true\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\" data-type=\"inline\"></p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-gie4aGGJ\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-O2Gag3FV\"><a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710549556236\" target=\"blank\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">营销投放数据报表</a>：营销投放相关数据，包括<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">项目</span></code>，<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">单元</span></code>，<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">创意</span></code>，<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">视频</span></code>等，精准分析营销投放效果，科学优化营销投放流程</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-8Z3amHb8\"><a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710554896384\" target=\"blank\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">受众分析数据</a>：受众分析数据包括<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">省市</span></code>、<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">市级</span></code>、<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">性别</span></code>、<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">年龄</span></code>、<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">行为兴趣</span></code>、<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">抖音达人</span></code>等纬度的数据。以便更加准确分析营销投放受众，进而调整计划定向信息，以便更加精准投放；</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-WdpIdeMU\"><a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710559123456\" target=\"blank\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">电商直播数据</a>用于获取<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">直播中</span></code>和<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">直播后</span></code>的数据，深入洞察账户内全部直播详细数据，科学化指导营销洞察</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-GNtAU50N\"><a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710562240524\" target=\"blank\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">异步数据报表</a>通过创建离线任务的方式，来一次性获取指定时间段的所有数据报表，<code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">减少接口调用次数</span></code>，方便取数</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-SjqTuxX8\"><a href=\"https://ad.oceanengine.com/openapi/doc/index.html?id=1696710565934095\" target=\"blank\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">数据报表使用说明</a>所有数据字段的解释说明</li></ul><h2 id=\"h490b8bf-Mj9D2NER\" data-id=\"h490b8bf-Mj9D2NER\">数据更新频率</h2><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-CbBILdjm\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-mm4DlU9W\"><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">数据5～10分钟更新一次</span></code>，正常情况8点～9点之间 的数据 ，10点可以稳定。在晚高峰的时候，可能需要3个小时能稳定；</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-9Z8D0D4b\"><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">第二天9点可以获取前一天稳定的消耗数据</span></code>；</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-R0zxrSS3\">一般历史数据都不会变，除了数据有问题有校对的情况会更新历史数据；</li></ul><h2 id=\"h490b8bf-JWl9FCBk\" data-id=\"h490b8bf-JWl9FCBk\">数据报表使用方式：报表、监控通知、自动化调整</h2><p data-id=\"p838747a-yizoTrPM\"><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"color: #f5222d;\">报表</span></code></p><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-gUcTaU3R\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-gn1sC2LT\">定时拉取数据，按照不同维度以及环比，生成自定报表发送给运营同学，以帮助运营同学了解投放情况；</p></blockquote><p data-id=\"p838747a-1uzOyaJv\"><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">监控通知</code></p><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-OAES7HOM\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-bLvtHLod\">某些组、计划、创意消耗达到预期的消耗或者成本，及时发通知（集成沟通平台：比如微信等）给到运营进行调整；</p></blockquote><p data-id=\"p838747a-IZ7TGHrY\"><code style=\"font-family: monospace; font-size: inherit; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06); padding: 0px 2px; border-radius: 6px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">自动化调整</code></p><blockquote data-id=\"b603af74-fo15ff33\" style=\"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px; padding-left: 1em; margin-left: 0px; border-left: 3px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); opacity: 0.6;\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-oB3kIbO4\">某些组、计划、创意消耗达到程序设定预期的消耗、成本、转化，然后进行调整出价、预算、或者是自动复制创建计划/创意，以满足整体的投放策略；</p></blockquote><p data-id=\"p838747a-9JhVzBqN\"><br></p></div>",
  "doc_type": 1,
  "going_offline": false,
  "is_new": false,
  "path": null,
  "title": "数据报表"
}
